message: "If you use this task, please cite it as below."
title: "Naivasha pesticides: a research-grade AI evaluation task in environmental chemistry"
abstract: "A Harbor-format evaluation task in which an AI agent recovers freely dissolved organochlorine pesticide concentrations in the Lake Naivasha basin, Kenya, from two passive-sampler types. Includes a seeded data generator, reference solution, hardened verifier and grader-validation harness."
authors:
